{"id":"vod_bf_29040","vodId":"29040","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"骚动时节的少女们啊","name_cn":"骚动时节的少女们啊","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/88e4626a0747bceade21c9bbafc822c9.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生于某所高中的文艺部内。很轻易就陷入妄想之中的小野寺和纱（河野日和 配音）、总是不经意之间做出惊人发言的菅原新菜（安济知佳 配音）、恋爱经历为零，异常单纯的文学少女须藤百百子（麻仓桃 配音）、想要创作属于自己的小说的本乡一叶（黑泽朋世 配音）和性格非常古板，对性的话题避之而不及的社长曾根崎莉香（上坂堇 配音），隶属于文艺部的是这五名性格迥异的部员。　　一天，大家正在讨论“死前想要做的事情”这一话题，平日里默默无闻的新菜突然暴言“想要体会一下性爱”，这句突如其来的发言让整个文艺部都陷入了混乱之中，少女们虽然对这句话的反映各异，但她们的心都被次撩动了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 12:17:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/saodongshijiedeshaonvmena/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31